    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Residential Excellence (001455) are delighted to offer this stunning two-bedroomed duplex, in the highly sought after area of Clontarf on the coast road. A first-floor apartment with breath-taking views all the way from Dublin Bay to the Dublin Mountains with a private balcony with seating area to enjoy the views.\r\n\r\nThe apartment is laid out over two floors, first floor accommodation offers very well-proportioned rooms with the entrance hallway leading to a large living/dining room with floor to ceiling windows overviewing the amazing views of Dublin, separate kitchen, double bedroom with ample storage, and separate bathroom.\r\n\r\nUpstairs storage areas on landing, attic storage,  and spacious family bathroom and very large master bedroom with built in storage, with eve storage as well and views to enjoy. \r\n\r\nBruach na Mara is a small and unique facility with beautiful gardens and underground secure car parking and basement storage. Access to direct bus routes, DART, and feet away from walking or cycling on the seafront, St Anne’s Park and Dollymount Strand. Local selection of cafes, restaurants, schools, clubs and other amenities.\r\n\r\nThis property is a unique opportunity to be close to sea with wonderful views and easy access to various locations and a gem where rarely a property of this stature comes to the market in this location, and it must be seen to be appreciated. The property is available now. \r\n\r\nViewing: Strictly by appointment with the Auctioneers, please email or call Donal on 0877774973 to arrange a viewing"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Two double bedrooms"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Stunning views \r\nFantastic location \r\nUnderground car parking \r\nB3 BER Rating\r\nLarge property 88.3 Square meters\r\nUnderground storage \r\nProperty storage - ample storage in hallway, living room, landing, bedroom, eves and attic."
      },
